This document was prepared by Technical Committee ISO/TC 108, Mechanical vibration, shock and condition
monitoring, Subcommittee SC 5, Condition monitoring and diagnostics of machine systems. This third edition cancels and replaces the second edition (ISO 13381-1:2015), which has been technically
revised. The main changes are as follows:
—	 update of definitions (for clarification purposes);
—	 revised data requirements;
—	 revised modelling types;
—	 revised failure modelling techniques (see Annex C);
—	 update of Bibliography. A list of all parts in the ISO 13381 series can be found on the ISO website. Any feedback or questions on this document should be directed to the user’s national standards body. A
complete listing of these bodies can be found at www.iso.org/members.html. iv
